     profile. This is the INTRA-COMMUNITY SUPPLY fixture: a German seller
     invoicing a VAT-registered business in another EU member state (France) for
     goods shipped across the border. The supply is exempt as an
     innergemeinschaftliche Lieferung (§ 4 Nr. 1b / § 6a UStG, EU VAT Directive
     art. 138), so every line carries VAT category code K ('VAT exempt for EEA
     intra-community supply of goods and services') at rate 0 and the invoice
     shows ZERO VAT.

     It exercises the K family the AE reverse-charge and S/Z/E fixtures never
     touch:
       * BG-4 SELLER + BG-6 seller contact + BT-31 seller VAT id (DE000000000,
         VAT-scoped) AND BG-7 BUYER + BT-48 buyer VAT id (FR00000000000) —
         BR-IC-02 demands a VAT-scoped Seller identifier AND the Buyer VAT id,
       * 2x BG-25 invoice lines, BOTH with BT-151 line VAT category = K and
         BT-152 line VAT rate = 0 (BR-IC-05),
       * exactly ONE BG-23 VAT breakdown with BT-118 category K, BT-116 taxable
         = Σ K line nets, and BT-117 tax amount = 0.00 (BR-IC-01/08/09),
       * the mandated intra-community exemption reason on that breakdown:
         BT-121 code VATEX-EU-IC (on the CEF VATEX list, BR-CL-22) AND the
         BT-120 reason text (BR-IC-10, presence-required),
       * BG-13 BT-72 Actual delivery date (BR-IC-11) AND a BG-15 deliver-to
         address with BT-80 country code FR (BR-IC-12) — the two K-only
         document-level requirements the AE family has no analogue for.
     BT-84 is the ISO 13616 documentation example IBAN (valid check digits), so
     the German SEPA IBAN check (BR-DE-19) is satisfied and the invoice is clean.

     ARITHMETIC (all internally consistent, EUR, VAT = 0 throughout):
       line 1 (K): 20 x 450.00 = 9000.00 -> BT-131 = 9000.00
       line 2 (K): 50 x  30.00 = 1500.00 -> BT-131 = 1500.00
       BT-106 sum of line nets = 9000 + 1500                  = 10500.00
       K breakdown base BT-116 = 9000 + 1500 = 10500.00 -> BT-117 = 0.00
       BT-109 tax exclusive = 10500.00 = sole breakdown base
       BT-110 total VAT = 0.00
       BT-112 tax inclusive = 10500.00 + 0.00 = 10500.00 = BT-115 payable -->
